  "definition": "Claimant Access to Electronic Correspondence",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-07-23",
  "historyNote": "#9528, eff 8-17-09; ss by #12480, INTERIM, eff 2-16-18, EXPIRES: 8-15-18; ss by #12588, eff 7-23-18",
